    "localImage": "chm-ashless-hardened-filter.jpg",
    "description": "<p>Ashless hardened Filter papers are acid hardened which reduce the ash content to an extremely low level. A maximum ash content of &lt;0.006% is attained, which means that no contaminants are introduced when filtering. Thanks to the hardened texture, they are often used when the analyst must recover the precipitates retained on the filter surface.</p><h3>Grades</h3><ul><li><strong>F2141 GRADE:</strong> Fast filtration. Preferably used for the filtration of coarse flocculent and bulky precipitates.</li><li><strong>F2140 GRADE:</strong> Medium filtration. Extremely strong and pure. Recommended for filtering medium-sized precipitates.</li><li><strong>F2142 GRADE:</strong> Slow filtration. High retention and slow flow rate. High chemical resistance.</li></ul>",
    "specification": "<table class=\"spec-table\" style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background:#f5f7fa;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 15px; font-weight:700; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Grade</th><th style=\"padding:10px 15px; font-weight:700; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Filtration Speed</th><th style=\"padding:10px 15px; font-weight:700; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Weight (g/m²)</th><th style=\"padding:10px 15px; font-weight:700; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Thickness (µm)</th><th style=\"padding:10px 15px; font-weight:700; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Retention Range (µm)</th><th style=\"padding:10px 15px; font-weight:700; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Ash Content (%)</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f5f7fa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">F2141</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Fast</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">84</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">170</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">20-25</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">&lt;0.006</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">F2140</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Medium</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">84</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">160</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">7-12</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">&lt;0.006</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f5f7fa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">F2142</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">Slow</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">95</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">150</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">2-4</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px; bo